  "translation": "Na king i aksim Tsiba: Dispela ol samting, bilong wanem yu gat ol? Na Tsiba i tok: Ol donki bilong ol manmeri long haus bilong king bilong raithaim, na bret na kaikai bilong taim kops bilong ol yangpela man kaikai, na wain bilong ol man i penahelt long ples wail, dringim.",
